   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S07",
    "title": [
     "LAUGHED AT",
     "THE WRONG THING?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 150.7
  },
  {
   "id": "g3",
   "start": 150.7,
   "line": "it wasn't a joke. Here's why it happens:",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S07",
    "title": [
     "LAUGHED AT",
     "THE WRONG THING?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 153.7
  },
  {
   "id": "g4",
   "start": 153.7,
   "line": "laughter is mostly social. One researcher found people were about thirty times more likely to laugh with others around than when they were alone.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S07",
    "title": [
     "LAUGHED AT",
     "THE WRONG THING?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 162.72
  },
  {
   "id": "g5",
   "start": 162.72,
   "line": "Your laugh isn't really about the joke.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S07",
    "title": [
     "LAUGHED AT",
     "THE WRONG THING?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 164.92
  },
  {
   "id": "g6",
   "start": 164.92,
   "line": "It's about the group.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S07",
    "title": [
     "LAUGHED AT",
     "THE WRONG THING?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 166.42
  },
  {
   "id": "g7",
   "start": 166.42,
   "line": "Send this to the friend who always laughs first.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S07",
    "title": [
     "LAUGHED AT",
     "THE WRONG THING?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 169.51
  },
  {
   "id": "g8",
   "start": 169.51,
   "line": "And the next time everyone laughs…",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S07",
    "title": [
     "LAUGHED AT",
     "THE WRONG THING?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 171.77
  },
  {
   "id": "o1",
   "start": 171.77,
   "line": "You're in line. You rehearse your order ten times.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "fade",
    "dur": 0.25
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S08",
    "title": [
     "PRACTICED YOUR",
     "ORDER 10 TIMES?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 175.22
  },
  {
   "id": "o2",
   "start": 175.22,
   "line": "Then it's your turn, and you say: \"Can I",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "at": 0.05,
     "name": "pop",
     "gain": -18
    }
   ],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S08",
    "title": [
     "PRACTICED YOUR",
     "ORDER 10 TIMES?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 179.36
  },
  {
   "id": "o3",
   "start": 179.36,
   "line": "get a… uh… large… small…",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S08",
    "title": [
     "PRACTICED YOUR",
     "ORDER 10 TIMES?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 181.59
  },
  {
   "id": "o4",
   "start": 181.59,
   "line": "thing?\" Psychologists call it choking under pressure.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S08",
    "title": [
     "PRACTICED YOUR",
     "ORDER 10 TIMES?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 185.48
  },
  {
   "id": "o5",
   "start": 185.48,
   "line": "When you watch yourself too closely, something you normally do on autopilot can fall apart.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S08",
    "title": [
     "PRACTICED YOUR",
     "ORDER 10 TIMES?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 190.89
  },
  {
   "id": "o6",
   "start": 190.89,
   "line": "Thinking about it too hard is what breaks it.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S08",
    "title": [
     "PRACTICED YOUR",
     "ORDER 10 TIMES?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 193.65
  },
  {
   "id": "o7",
   "start": 193.65,
   "line": "Send this to the friend who practices their order.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S08",
    "title": [
     "PRACTICED YOUR",
     "ORDER 10 TIMES?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 196.46
  },
  {
   "id": "o8",
   "start": 196.46,
   "line": "And the next time you're in line…",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S08",
    "title": [
     "PRACTICED YOUR",
     "ORDER 10 TIMES?"
    ]
   },
   "end": 198.47
  },
  {
   "id": "y1",
   "start": 198.47,
   "line": "You read your message five times.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "fade",
    "dur": 0.25
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 200.6
  },
  {
   "id": "y2",
   "start": 200.6,
   "line": "It's perfect. You hit send.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "at": 0.05,
     "name": "pop",
     "gain": -18
    }
   ],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 202.82
  },
  {
   "id": "y3",
   "start": 202.82,
   "line": "And there it is: a typo.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 205.27
  },
  {
   "id": "y4",
   "start": 205.27,
   "line": "Why do you only see it after sending?",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 209.31
  },
  {
   "id": "y5",
   "start": 209.31,
   "line": "When you check your own words,",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 211.75
  },
  {
   "id": "y6",
   "start": 211.75,
   "line": "your brain already knows what you meant,",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 215.53
  },
  {
   "id": "y7",
   "start": 215.53,
   "line": "so it reads what it expects instead of what's actually there.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 220.53
  },
  {
   "id": "y8",
   "start": 220.53,
   "line": "Once it's sent, you read it like a stranger would.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 225.36
  },
  {
   "id": "y9",
   "start": 225.36,
   "line": "Send this to the friend who unsends everything.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 229.24
  },
  {
   "id": "y10",
   "start": 229.24,
   "line": "Now read your last text again…",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S09",
    "title": [
     "WHY YOU SEE TYPOS",
     "AFTER SENDING"
    ]
   },
   "end": 230.81
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "start": 230.81,
   "line": "\"Seen.\" No reply. And now you can't think about anything else.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "fade",
    "dur": 0.25
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S10",
    "title": [
     "\"SEEN\"",
     "NO REPLY"
    ]
   },
   "end": 234.81
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "start": 234.81,
   "line": "Unfinished things tend to stick in the mind.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [
    {
     "at": 0.05,
     "name": "pop",
     "gain": -18
    }
   ],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S10",
    "title": [
     "\"SEEN\"",
     "NO REPLY"
    ]
   },
   "end": 238.79
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "start": 238.79,
   "line": "Psychologists call it the Zeigarnik effect:",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S10",
    "title": [
     "\"SEEN\"",
     "NO REPLY"
    ]
   },
   "end": 241.64
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "start": 241.64,
   "line": "an open loop keeps pulling your attention back until it's closed.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S10",
    "title": [
     "\"SEEN\"",
     "NO REPLY"
    ]
   },
   "end": 247.7
  },
  {
   "id": "s5",
   "start": 247.7,
   "line": "A message with no reply is an open loop.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S10",
    "title": [
     "\"SEEN\"",
     "NO REPLY"
    ]
   },
   "end": 252.45
  },
  {
   "id": "s6",
   "start": 252.45,
   "line": "That's why you keep checking.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S10",
    "title": [
     "\"SEEN\"",
     "NO REPLY"
    ]
   },
   "end": 255.1
  },
  {
   "id": "s7",
   "start": 255.1,
   "line": "Send this to the friend who replies three days later.",
   "scene": "",
   "set": "v",
   "bars": null,
   "in": {
    "type": "cut"
   },
   "sfx": [],
   "notes": "",
   "params": {
    "short": "S10",
    "title": [
     "\"SEEN\"",
     "NO REPLY"
    ]
   },
   "end": 258.8
  },
